tle_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322519002:1":{"text":"의사는 이상한 점이 없다고 말하는 걸 보면 이건 분명 마법이에요. 이상한 마법이라고요...","source_cn":"但医生又说没事，也许这是魔法，奇怪的魔法……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC533BD7C471BCE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:不安的镇民":{"text":"불안한 마을 주민","source":"不安的镇民","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13225200.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13225200","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13225200","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322520001:1":{"text":"하늘에서 천천히 내려오면서 세상을 내려다보는 듯한 기분이 드는 꿈을 꿨어요.","source_cn":"我梦到自己从天而降，俯视众生，缓慢飘落。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD8B9AB1A5500766","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322520002:1":{"text":"아... 순수함에서 탁함으로, 따뜻함에서 차가움으로...","source_cn":"噢……从纯净到污秽，从温暖到冰冷。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6812C13540BDDAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:唠叨的镇民":{"text":"수다스러운 마을 주민","source":"唠叨的镇民","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":1}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13225210.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13225210","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13225210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322521001: